s.aspx\">wedding photographers<\/a> in Los Angeles, New York\u2019s top <a href=\"http:\/\/wedding.theknot.com\/wedding-resources\/wedding-cakes-desserts.aspx\">cake bakers<\/a> or Miami\u2019s hottest <a href=\"http:\/\/wedding.theknot.com\/wedding-resources\/wedding-reception-venues.aspx\">reception sites<\/a>, engaged couples across the country want the inside scoop on the best from real brides.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><i>\u201cWe are truly honored to have won this prestigious award for the last 5 years and wish to continue providing the best entertainment to our clients for years to come ~ John Murray (Owner)\u201d<\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs NAMED WINNER IN THE KNOT BEST OF WEDDINGS 2014 JAMMIN&#8217; DJ&#8217;s Denver Georgia 2014 &#8212; JAMMIN\u2019 DJs are pleased to announce They have been selected as a 2014 \u00ad\u00adwinner in The Knot Best of Weddings, a special section featured on TheKnot.com\/BOW. TheKnot.com the number-one wedding destination, most trusted by brides. This is the&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":4136,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[10,22],"tags":[58,59,71,98],"class_list":["post-4057","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog","category-press-release","tag-award-winning-dj-service","tag-awards","tag-best-wedding-entertainment","tag-denver-wedding-awaard"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>The Knot Best in Weddings 2014 - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/blog\/knot-best-weddings-2014\/\" \